WEBVTT

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:30.776
That's not the pattern today.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:33.176
If you're in your late
50s and in good health,

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:37.616
you're going to live easily
another 20 or 25 years.

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:40.256
That's a really long time
to make ends meet

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:41.520
if you are broke.

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:45.376
So what's the play if you've landed here

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:48.240
and you're 50 or 55 or 60?

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:51.976
What's the play
if you don't want to land here

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:55.136
and you're 22 or 32?

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:57.520
Here's what I've learned
from my own experience.

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.200
The cavalry's not coming.